  "contentHtml": "<p>깊이있는 학습, 질문이 있는 교실을 위해서</p><p>학생의 질문에 교사는 &#39;답&#39;으로 대답하지 않고,</p><p>&#39;질문&#39;으로 대답하는 것이 중요합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>학생의 질문에 &#39;꼬리질문으로&#39; 답하는 것을</p><p>연습하는 앱을 만들었습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>일단</p><p>교사의 꼬리 질문을 4가지로 유목화해보았습니다.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/178a3d83df5bd55af25ad1e46039d340b925c25d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/178a3d83df5bd55af25ad1e46039d340b925c25d\" data-origin-width=\"1105\" data-origin-height=\"600\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/afba31298a31b86e310c2da414c91bcd921dd901\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/afba31298a31b86e310c2da414c91bcd921dd901\" data-origin-width=\"1079\" data-origin-height=\"620\"></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0cc30240f3e114815d3637941f1db7102d6bc7fc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0cc30240f3e114815d3637941f1db7102d6bc7fc\" data-origin-width=\"1067\" data-origin-height=\"629\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b9d87ef3162c005dd4ec752fad1e18591da74083\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b9d87ef3162c005dd4ec752fad1e18591da74083\" data-origin-width=\"1073\" data-origin-height=\"619\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4cd030090d403c467ebf103b948eeb93196863d0\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"560\" height=\"319\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4cd030090d403c467ebf103b948eeb93196863d0\" data-origin-width=\"1075\" data-origin-height=\"613\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>아래와 같이</p><p>1단계 : 내용 입력</p><p>2단계 : 질문을 1개 고르고, 교사의 꼬리질문 작성</p><p>3단계 : 피드백 및 9개 질문, 모범 꼬리질문, 해답 가이드 제시해줍니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c87126df9af91f0d08326332dec7f4902288e2d3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c87126df9af91f0d08326332dec7f4902288e2d3\" data-origin-width=\"544\" data-origin-height=\"307\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/15b251d7fd86d85a5905b9678b32ca44957dccca\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/15b251d7fd86d85a5905b9678b32ca44957dccca\" data-origin-width=\"547\" data-origin-height=\"588\"></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c5e712b2a1134c64137fdd6e91fffe1bbd2f7a2f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c5e712b2a1134c64137fdd6e91fffe1bbd2f7a2f\" data-origin-width=\"507\" data-origin-height=\"431\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a0390efcac85132ec212b0d1f02ca35e36501cda\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a0390efcac85132ec212b0d1f02ca35e36501cda\" data-origin-width=\"561\" data-origin-height=\"615\"></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 50%;\"></td><td style=\"width: 50%;\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">꼬리질문 생성 앱</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160; : 피드백 결과를 한글 파일로 다운로드 받을 수&#160; 있습니다~</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><a href=\"https://share.gemini.google/u5Xa0xSRzj9f\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://share.gemini.google/u5Xa0xSRzj9f</a></span></p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
